+ * @no_bw_votes:           Don't set the OPPs (bandwidth votes) on frequency changes
+ * @osm_setup:             SoC specific OSM programming, instead of the generic one
+ * @setup_clocks:          SoC specific clock setup before OSM programming
  * @setup_regs:            Register offsets for OSM setup
  */
 
